lambdaFocus
#
# File: lambdaFocus.lut
#
# This file contains the lookup table describing how the best GMOS
# focus varies with wavelength, in terms of an offset from the focus
# measured at 400 nanometres. The GMOS software will interpolate
# between the entries in this table.
#
# Information from measurements by Rick Murowinski at DAO and
# by Jeremy Allington-Smith Isobel Hook and Stephanie Juneau on
# 4, 5 and 7 July 2000. Extended to 1100nm on 28 February 2001.
#
# Wavelength (nm)  focus offset (microns)
#
300.0              -500.0
400.0                 0.0
450.0               120.0
500.0               140.0
550.0                80.0
600.0                30.0
700.0               -80.0
800.0              -120.0
900.0              -170.0
1000.0             -200.0
1100.0             -225.0
1200.0             -240.0
